{"schemaVersion":1,"unitId":"u005","words":[{"word":"today","phonetic":"/təˈdeɪ/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 今天","pos":"adv","usage":"指说话时的当天"}]},{"word":"well","phonetic":"/wel/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 健康的","pos":"adj","usage":"修饰动词"},{"meaning":"身体好的（用于描述身体状况） adv.. 好"},{"meaning":"很好地"}]},{"word":"thanks","phonetic":"/θæŋks/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 谢谢","pos":"n","usage":"表示感谢的名词复数形式"},{"meaning":"感谢"}]},{"word":"goodbye","phonetic":"/ɡʊdˈbaɪ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"interj.. 再见","usage":"告别时使用的用语"}]},{"word":"see","phonetic":"/siː/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 看见","pos":"v","usage":"表示视觉上的看见"},{"meaning":"看到"}]},{"word":"fine","phonetic":"/faɪn/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 很好的","pos":"adj","usage":"口语中表示身体状况好"},{"meaning":"健康的"}]},{"word":"too","phonetic":"/tuː/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 也","pos":"adv","usage":"用于肯定句末，表示也一样"},{"meaning":"同样"}]},{"word":"how","phonetic":"/haʊ/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 怎样","pos":"adv","usage":"用于询问方式、状态等"},{"meaning":"如何"}]},{"word":"hello","phonetic":"/həˈləʊ/","meanings":[{"meaning":"interj.. 你好","usage":"打招呼用语"},{"meaning":"喂"}]},{"word":"nice","phonetic":"/naɪs/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 美好的","pos":"adj","usage":"形容事物或人令人满意"},{"meaning":"令人愉快的"}]},{"word":"very","phonetic":"/ˈveri/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 非常","pos":"adv","usage":"修饰形容词或副词，加强程度"},{"meaning":"很"}]},{"word":"and","phonetic":"/ænd/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 和","pos":"conj","usage":"连接并列成分"},{"meaning":"而且"}]}],"phrases":[{"phrase":"How are you today?","usage":"询问对方今天身体状况的常用问候语","examples":[{"en":"How are you today?","zh":"你今天好吗？"}]},{"phrase":"I'm very well","usage":"回答身体状况，表示非常好/很健康","examples":[{"en":"I'm very well, thank you.","zh":"我非常好，谢谢你。"}]},{"phrase":"And you?","usage":"询问对方情况时的简略表达，常用于回答之后反问对方","examples":[{"en":"I'm fine, thanks. And you?","zh":"我很好，谢谢。你呢？"}]},{"phrase":"How is + 人名?","usage":"询问第三方身体状况的句型","examples":[{"en":"How is Emma?","zh":"Emma 好吗？"}]},{"phrase":"He's/She's fine thanks","usage":"回答第三方状况的常用表达","examples":[{"en":"He's fine, thanks.","zh":"他很好，谢谢。"}]},{"phrase":"Nice to see you","usage":"久别重逢时的问候语，表达见到对方很高兴","examples":[{"en":"Nice to see you.","zh":"很高兴见到你。"}]},{"phrase":"Goodbye","usage":"分别时的告别语","examples":[{"en":"Goodbye, Helen.","zh":"再见，Helen。"}]}],"grammar":[{"title":"How are you? 询问身体状况句型","structure":"How + am/is/are + 主语 + (today)?","definition":"How are you? 是英语中询问他人身体或状况的常用问候语，属于特殊疑问句 用于日常问候，可根据对象选择 am/is/are","examples":[{"en":"How are you today?","zh":"你今天好吗？"},{"en":"How is he?","zh":"他好吗？"},{"en":"How are they?","zh":"他们好吗？"}]},{"title":"Be动词引导的一般疑问句","structure":"Am/Is/Are + 主语 + 形容词/副词?","definition":"将 Be 动词（am/is/are）提前到句首构成的疑问句，必须用 Yes 或 No 回答 用于询问某人或某物的状态、状况","examples":[{"en":"Are you well today?","zh":"你今天身体好吗？"},{"en":"Is Emma fine?","zh":"Emma 好吗？"}]},{"title":"Too 的用法","structure":"主语 + 动词 + 其他 + too.","definition":"too 是副词，意为\"也\"，用于肯定句末，通常用逗号与前文隔开 表示与前面提到的情况相同，用于肯定句和疑问句的肯定回答后","examples":[{"en":"I'm well, and she's well too.","zh":"我很好，她也很好。"},{"en":"Nice to see you too.","zh":"也很高兴见到你。"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"How are you today?","original":{"en":"How are you today?","zh":"你今天好吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"How are you tomorrow?","zh":"你明天好吗？"},{"en":"How are you this morning?","zh":"你今天上午好吗？"}]},{"pattern":"I'm + 形容词","original":{"en":"I'm very well, thank you.","zh":"我非常好，谢谢你。"},"imitations":[{"en":"I'm fine, thanks.","zh":"我很好，谢谢。"},{"en":"I'm not bad.","zh":"我还不错。"}]},{"pattern":"How is + 人名?","original":{"en":"How is Emma?","zh":"Emma 好吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"How is Tom?","zh":"Tom 好吗？"},{"en":"How is your mother?","zh":"你妈妈好吗？"}]},{"pattern":"Nice to see you","original":{"en":"Nice to see you.","zh":"很高兴见到你。"},"imitations":[{"en":"Nice to see you again.","zh":"很高兴再次见到你。"},{"en":"Nice to see you too.","zh":"我也很高兴见到你。"}]}]}